{title: When the Saints Go Marching In}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Oh, when the [C]saints go marching [C]in,
Oh, when the [C]saints go marching [G7]in,
Oh, how I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number,
When the [C]saints go [G7]marching [C]in.

{c: Verse 2}
Oh, when the [C]sun refuse to [C]shine,
Oh, when the [C]sun refuse to [G7]shine,
Oh, how I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number,
When the [C]sun re[G7]fuse to [C]shine.
